<h3><u>Kehti thi maa</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haaye haaye haaye haaye</p>

<p>Barsa falak se khoon larazne lagi zameen<br />
aandhi siyaah dashte bayabaan me chali<br />
yeh waqt bhi qayamate kubra se kam nahi<br />
jalti zameen pe aakhri sajde me hai jabeen<br />
baali pe maa hussain ki aur pusht pe laeen</p>

<p>kehti thi maa theher zara shimr theher jaa<br />
do bund mere bacche ko pani toh pilaa de</p>

<p>1. Sunkar duhai fatahe badro honain se<br />
yeh rashk gunjta hai mere shoro shain se<br />
akbar ko katl kar ke bhi baithe na chain se<br />
kya dushmani hai tumko mere dilke chain se<br />
kya bugz tumko ho gaya mere hussain se</p>

<p>2. Subh e dahan se laash uthata raha yaha<br />
roya hai is ghareeb ki ghurbat pe aasmaa<br />
bacche shaheed ho gaye maare gaye jawaa<br />
haatho pe iske qatl hua ek bezabaa<br />
ab iske khoo ke pyase hue khanjaro sina</p>

<p>3. Aaya jo katl gaah me yeh zulm ka aseer<br />
pursaane haal tha na koi aur na dastgeer<br />
patthar kisine maare kisine sina o teer<br />
naiza kisine maara chalaaye kisine teer<br />
yeh zulm dekha rone laga khuld ka ameer</p>

<p>4. Ghash khake jo ghode pe jhuka mera dilafgaar<br />
khun rone laga aur sare mazlum pe talwaar<br />
sar thaamke haatho se jo seena hua ek baar<br />
barchi kisi laeen ke seene se hui waar<br />
tar ho gaya lahu se badan dil hua figaar</p>

<p>5. Teeron ki nazr chand sa seena jo ho gaya<br />
in zalimon ne seene ko teero se bhar dia<br />
zeen se zami pe aane laga jab pisar mera<br />
aaya nai zameen pe teero pe ruk gaya<br />
is zulm pe bhi reham na aaya tujhe zara</p>

<p>6. Ae sang dil khuda ka payambar ka khauf kar<br />
kassab bhi zabiho ko zibha se thehar kar<br />
itna toh pani dete hai ho jaae halq tar<br />
zakhmon se chur chur hai pyaasa mera pisar<br />
khanjar chalega kis tarah pyaase ke halq par</p>

<p>7. Zainab hai ek ret ke tile pe nauha gar<br />
manzar yeh dekhti hai sambhale hue jigar<br />
ankho me ashk lab pe buka aur barehna sar<br />
mar jaaegi woh khwaahare mazlum dekhkar<br />
tan se juda na kijiyo us waqt sheh ka sar</p>

<p>8. Tadpe zamee pe khaak udate hue haider<br />
aaye khadija aur payambar bhi nauhagar<br />
saidaaniyon me bain dare khaima pe dukhtar<br />
nazdeek tha woh waqt ke kat jaaye sheh ka sar<br />
zahra ne gala rakh diya bete ke gale par</p>

<p>9. Mazhar kaha se mai woh takate bayaan<br />
mai likh saku shahadate mazloom ab yaha<br />
hamraah mere rote hai yeh saaton aasmaan<br />
farhan nahi nahi yeh kalam bhi hai nauhagaa<br />
bete ko qatl hote hue dekhti thi maa</p>

<p>Haaye haaye haaye haaye haaye...</p>
</p>
